        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi wamiy Were dwoŋ manyalo miyo wicungo matek i yeyo, i Wac Manyen Maber m'afonjo win, mikwenda kwoŋ Yesu Kristo, kodi kwoŋ nyutho adieri manyaliŋliŋ m'onwaŋo opan oro kweth m'okadho. ",
          "type": "text",
