          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To pama adieri no otiek wodho kamaler i ndiko pa jotuci wac Were; kodi i or pa Were ma cil gi cil, ma onyo imiyo nonin je ŋeyo, aka ji je jowoŋey odoko jowowinji.",
          "type": "text",
